==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's standard illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Sword & Shield|Galvantula|71}} from the {{TCG|Sword & Shield}} expansion.
*'''Electric Shock''' (サンダーショック) is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|Primal Clash|Manectric|61}} from the {{TCG|Primal Clash}} expansion.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

